# BetOnline full-page loader

Use `startDeepLink(href)` + `FullPageLoader` for **cross-context redirects**. Use `startNavigating(href)` for **in-chrome soft nav**.

## Show full-page loader

- **Hard refresh / cold open** — `SiteArrivalLoader` in the root layout (every document load)
- **Deep links** — `startDeepLink(href)`: UBC → account pages, poker → `/promotions?filter=poker`, etc.

## Do NOT show full-page loader (`startNavigating` only)

- Top header product links (Casino / Sports / Poker / Promotions)
- Product chips
- Casino / account / promo sub-nav
- Sidebar / drawer product nav within the shell

## Implementation

- Component: `apps/live-site/components/site/full-page-loader.tsx` + `betonline-loader.tsx`
- Script: `apps/live-site/public/betonline-loader.js` (from `public/betonline-loader/`)
- API: `useShell().startDeepLink(href)` / `useShell().fullPageLoader`
